---
description: TypeScript quality for Orbital — strict, small APIs, no accidental any
globs: "{src,scripts,evals}/**/*.{ts,mts,mjs}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript quality

- Respect `strict: true`; avoid `any` unless unavoidable and localized
- Prefer small modules and clear public APIs over giant files
- Surface errors with actionable messages; do not swallow silently
- Pure functions for decision/throttle/classifier/brain logic so Vitest can cover them
- Dependency-inject clock/random/storage in new core code
